    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The central core has been seized by the enemy, and it\u2019s up to you to take back control!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between two unique characters, customize them to match your playstyle, and battle an army of modular enemies across areas randomly selected for each run! Get ready for a fast-paced, dynamic arcade experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock chips and discover upgrades to unlock even more customization options for your next run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly dispatch enemies and bosses with powerful weapon combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle escalating challenges across four distinct difficulty levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For dedicated players: aim for high area scores in the tougher modes or test your speed in Speedrun mode, with a fixed area sequence and a timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you achieve 100% completion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.poster.avif?t=1742034514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.webm?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.mp4?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 115 areas, randomly selected and arranged for every run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 chips to upgrade and arm your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 difficulty levels to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 players in simultaneous co-op action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 life \u2013 make it count. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.poster.avif?t=1742034514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.webm?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.mp4?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The central core has been seized by the enemy, and it\u2019s up to you to take back control!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between two unique characters, customize them to match your playstyle, and battle an army of modular enemies across areas randomly selected for each run! Get ready for a fast-paced, dynamic arcade experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock chips and discover upgrades to unlock even more customization options for your next run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly dispatch enemies and bosses with powerful weapon combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle escalating challenges across four distinct difficulty levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For dedicated players: aim for high area scores in the tougher modes or test your speed in Speedrun mode, with a fixed area sequence and a timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you achieve 100% completion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.poster.avif?t=1742034514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.webm?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/3a536ad68e6cd7cc02e7892b8574802f.mp4?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 115 areas, randomly selected and arranged for every run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 chips to upgrade and arm your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 difficulty levels to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 players in simultaneous co-op action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 life \u2013 make it count. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.poster.avif?t=1742034514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.webm?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091300/extras/f0b4a2a0e79092b86610a2411d88c20b.mp4?t=1742034514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
